caping a bunch of murderous Kree  soldiers he can handle a few  gods we also learned that the name to  the Avengers initiative was inspired by  Carol Danvers whose callsign as a pilot  was Avenger Fiore super pager which he  used to contact captain marvel at the  end of Avengers infinity war gets an  origin story - in all numbers and a  quest had a definitive impact on Fiore  personally and the larger and folding of  the MCU and yet the pages still raises  at least one huge question about what  defines an emergency - Nick Fury in  Avengers for instance a wormhole opened  over Manhattan and pooped out a bunch of  alien invaders  the second Avengers movie featured a  super evil robot attempting a world  takeover and an entire city floating in  the sky  those weren't emergencies MCU boss Kevin  Feige offered an answer to that question  during the weekend of Captain Marvel's  release when asked by slash film why  fury never hid the pager during those  other crises Feige answered how do you  know he never hit her how do we know he  never pushed it before we've never seen  him push it before that doesn't mean he  never did the mid-credits scene in  Captain Marvel gives us a preview of  Avengers endgame Danvers swoops into  Avengers HQ in response to Fury's pager  which has been sending a signal into  space since infinity war's end it  confirms that Captain Marvel will have a  significant role in the restoration of  half the universe's population good  thing she wasn't dusted to be on mass  it's likely we'll get more adventures  with Captain Marvel on earth once end  games credits roll while she's unlocked  most if not all of her pre cream  memories she still hasn't spent time we  acclimating to life on her homeworld the  events of Captain Marvel take place in  1995 six years after her abduction  now she's returned home after another 20  years though she still looks as young as  ever thanks to her super-powered creep  Lud and just like Captain America before  her Danvers is out of her own time and  we all probably see her struggling to  reconnect after over a quarter century  away from home additionally Monica  Rambeau Maria's daughter probably has a  role to play based on the characters  history from the comics in 1982 she made  her debut as a hero named Captain Marvel  although her origin story didn't really  have anything to do with Danvers Marvel  or the Kree in the MCU though she'll be  20 years older and probably ready to  either join Captain Marvel on her next  adventure  or become her own Captain Marvel further  down the line  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the Marvel Cinematic Universe are coming  soon subscribe to our YouTube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Music]
 

